# AlHaitham Yae Lauma Xianyun. ~18s Rot. KQMS KurtC. AlHaitham Spread plunge. Does short hold skill into 7x N1JhP & Q if available. 70% collisions after E plunge. Xianyun's energy is tight.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
haitham char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
haitham add weapon="harbinger" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
haitham add set="lno" count=4;
